{"3300050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "System Breakdown", "steam_appid": 3300050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4776560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/dc79413fc4b2dea016aa1fa8e6c151d6.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/119bd1dba0a5f9ad3b1e5db41521b56a.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Breakdown is not just a twin-stick shooter. You need to be aggressive in order to survive. Cycle between guns to gain ammunition. Perform the finisher move to heal yourself. Use special power-ups to destroy Clankers' armor and charge your Fury. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games, such as <strong>Ruiner</strong> or <strong>Kill Knight</strong>, you will feel at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/bba488046ab6096b57d092aa703d55b5.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.webm?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8dcfecfc07d7888022f541268de077b.mp4?t=1786550567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Brother monitors everything. The better you perform in trials, the more resources you earn for advanced weaponry and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own style of destruction. Do you want to focus on pushing enemies onto a rocket explosion, or a Kimbo assault rifle Rambo Style? <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/3593c7490f6e01c45c5145ebf42bb21e.poster.avif?t=1786550567\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"